[en.FOCUS_C09_SH]
The City of the Past

[en.FOCUS_C09_SH_desc]
After Firelight stopped Stellar Flare turning Sire’s Hollow historical heritage into another Las Pegasus, she turned her focus outside to the so-called “The City of the Future”.\nBe as she may, we should not pour all our resources into that new city which doesn’t even belong to us. We should focus on our own city, our own citizens, and our own tradition.

[en.FOCUS_C09_SH_TOOLTIP]
The population growth rate of §Y[432.GetName]§! will slightly increase.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH]
历史之城

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_desc]
在火光阻止了恒星耀斑把名流谷的历史遗产变成又一个洛马基之后，她的视线便转向了外侧，那个所谓的“未来之城”。\n随她怎么想吧，我们不应该把所有资源都倾注到那个甚至不属于我们的新城市上。我们应该专注于我们自己的城市，我们自己的居民，和我们自己的传统。

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_TOOLTIP]
§Y[432.GetName]§!的马口增长率将轻微提高。

